@startuml
title bdd [block] EventBook logical architecture
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
class "Web client" as UI <<block>> { + renderScreens() + submitBooking() }
class "Application server" as API <<block>> { + authenticate() + createBooking() + createEvent() }
class "Data store" as DB <<block>> { events : Event[*] bookings : Booking[*] }
class "Event" as Event <<block>> { id title date time venue price capacity booked }
class "Booking" as Booking <<block>> { id eventId email quantity total status }
UI --> API : JSON/HTTP
API --> DB : read/write
DB *-- Event
DB *-- Booking
note right of API
Role authorisation, input validation,
and capacity validation execute here.
end note
@enduml
